#: huma-control:2567
msgid ""
"This laptop has no light sensor; ambient light is measured with the camera. "
"During a measurement the camera light turns on briefly (~1.5 s) and no image "
"is saved; nothing is measured while another app is using the camera (a "
"meeting). While you are at the computer it is measured at the measurement "
"interval, when you come back from a break and after Fn+F6. The scale has no "
"upper limit: dark room ~0-20, normal room ~50-255; in brighter light (by a "
"window, sunlight) the camera shortens the exposure and the value goes into "
"the hundreds or thousands."
